{"chapter_id":"main-quest-20073","main_id":20073,"main_title":"应急补给","main_description":"为了让一些过于莽撞的冒险家不至于在雪山中遇险，里瑟先生正准备在雪山里放置一些应急补给…","chapter_title":"应急补给","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2007301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2007301,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":200730106,"next_line_ids":[200730107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1671,"speaker_text_hash":3937849101,"speaker":"里瑟","speaker_raw":"里瑟","text_hash":745077994,"text":"你也知道的，就算是劝他们不能轻易上去，他们也不会听，就是要往雪山里走。","raw_text":"你也知道的，就算是劝他们不能轻易上去，他们也不会听，就是要往雪山里走。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2007301.json"}
